<p>[PTS]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neuter</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">abbu.lhana</span></p><p>the pulling out (of a sting), in phrase <em>taṇhā-sallassa abbuḷhanaṃ</em> as one of the 12 achievements of a Mahesi Mnd.343 = Cnd.503 (ed<!-- raw HTML omitted -->s.<!-- raw HTML omitted --> of Nd i.have abbūhana, variant reading SS abbussāna; ed. of Nd ii.abbuḷhana, variant reading SS abbahana, BB abbuhana). Cp. <em><a href="bword://abb%C4%81hana">abbāhana</a></em>.</p><p>fr. abbahati = abbuhati (abbuḷhati)</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://abbāhana">abbāhana</a></p>

abbuḷhasalla|abbu.lhasalla|abbulhasalla
