<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">caus. pr. 3 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">abhinipphaadeti</span></p><p>produces; effects; makes appear; obtains</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://abhinipphajjati">abhinipphajjati</a></p>

abhinipphādeti|abhinipphaadeti|abhinipphadeti
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">abhinipphaadeti</span></p><p>to bring into existence, produce, effect, work, perform DN.i.78 (bhājana-vikatiṃ) Vin.ii.183 (iddhiṃ); SN.v.156, SN.v.255; Mil.39.</p><p>abhi + nipphādeti</p>

abhinipphādita|abhinipphaadita|abhinipphadita
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">pp mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">abhinipphaadita</span></p><p>produced; obtained</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://abhinipphajjati">abhinipphajjati</a></p>

abhinippīḷana|abhinippii.lana|abhinippilana
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neuter \~ā, feminine</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">abhinippii.lana</span></p><p>pressing.</p>

abhinippīḷanā|abhinippii.lanaa|abhinippilana
<p>[PTS]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">feminine</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">abhinippii.lanaa</span></p><p>pressing, squeezing, taking hold of Vin.iii.121 (+ abhiniggaṇhanā).</p><p>abstr. to abhinippīḷeti, cp. nippīḷana</p>

