<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">part. pr. mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">abhinippii.laya</span></p><p>Also written as: <a href="bword://abhinippīḷayat">abhinippīḷayat</a></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://abhinippīḷayati">abhinippīḷayati</a></p>

