abhinipāti|abhinipaati|abhinipati
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">abhinipaati</span></p><p>Also written as: <a href="bword://abhinipātin">abhinipātin</a></p><p>falling upon, rushing at.</p>

