abhiniropana
<p>[PTS]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neuter &amp;</i></p><p><em><a href="bword://%C4%81">ā</a></em> (f.) fixing one’s mind upon, application of the mind Pts.i.16, Pts.i.21, Pts.i.30, Pts.i.69 Pts.i.75, Pts.i.90; Vb.87; Dhs.7, Dhs.21, Dhs.298 (cp. <em>Dhs trsl.</em> ii.19) See also <em><a href="bword://abhiropana">abhiropana</a></em>.</p><p>fr. abhiniropeti</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://ā">ā</a>, <a href="bword://abhiropana">abhiropana</a></p>

