<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">abhinisiidati</span></p><p>to sit down by or on (acc.), always comb<!-- raw HTML omitted -->d.<!-- raw HTML omitted --> with <em><a href="bword://abhinipajjati">abhinipajjati</a></em> Vin.iii.29; Vin.iv.273; AN.v.188; Pp.67.</p><p>abhi + nisīdati</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://abhinipajjati">abhinipajjati</a></p>

