adhivāseti|adhivaaseti|adhivaseti
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">adhivaaseti</span></p><ol><li>to wait for (c. acc.) Ja.i.254; Ja.ii.352 Ja.iii.277.</li><li>to have patience, bear, endure (c. acc.) DN.ii.128, DN.ii.157; Ja.i.46; Ja.iii.281 (pahāre); Ja.iv.279, Ja.iv.407; Ja.v.51 Ja.v.200; Vv-a.336, Vv-a.337.</li><li>to consent, agree, give in Vin.i.17; DN.i.109 (cp. DN-a.i.277); SN.iv.76; Dhp-a.i.33; Pv-a.17, Pv-a.20, Pv-a.75 and freq. passim</li></ol><p>caus <em>adhivāsāpeti</em> to cause to wait Ja.i.254.</p><p>Caus. of adhivasati, cp. BSk. adhivāsayati in meaning of 3</p>

