adhivāsika|adhivaasika|adhivasika
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">adhivaasika</span></p><p>Adhivāsaka &amp; Adhivāsika</p><p>adjective willing, agreeable, enduring, patient Vin.iv.130; MN.i.10, MN.i.526; AN.ii.118 AN.iii.163; AN.v.132; Ja.iii.369 (an˚); Ja.iv.11, Ja.iv.77.</p><p>fr. adhivāsa</p>

