aggapada
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neuter</i></p><p>the best word, the best teaching; the best state or place</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://agga">agga</a></p>

aggapasāda|aggapasaada|aggapasada
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">masculine</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aggapasaada</span></p><p>Also written as: <a href="bword://aggappasāda">aggappasāda</a></p><p>the best trust; trust in the best.</p>

