ajjhoharaṇiya|ajjhohara.niya|ajjhoharaniya
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">ajjhohara.niya</span></p><p>adjective something fit to eat, eatable, for eating Ja.vi.258; Dhp-a.i.284.</p><p>grd. of ajjhoharati</p>

ajjhoharitabba
