akappiya
<p>[NCPED]</p><p></p><p>akappiya<!-- raw HTML omitted -->1<!-- raw HTML omitted --></p><p>mfn. not lawful or acceptable (for <em>bhikkhus</em> or <em>bhikkhunīs</em>); unsuitable, improper</p><p>akappiya<!-- raw HTML omitted -->2<!-- raw HTML omitted --></p><p>mfn. not to be theorised about; not subject to imaginings</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://kappiya">kappiya</a>, <a href="bword://kappiya">kappiya</a></p>

