akāraṇa|akaara.na|akarana
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neuter</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">akaara.na</span></p><p>absence of a cause or (a valid) reason; not a cause; not the case</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://kāraṇa">kāraṇa</a></p>

akāresi|akaaresi|akaresi
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">aor. 3 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">akaaresi</span></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://kāreti">kāreti</a></p>

akāriya|akaariya|akariya
