<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">anabhisambhu.namaana</span></p><p>adjective not obtaining, unable to get or keep up DN.i.101 (= asampāpuṇanto avisahamāno vā DN-a.i.268).</p><p>ppr. med. of an + abhisambhuṇāti</p>

