anabhisaṅkharonta|anabhisa"nkharonta|anabhisankharonta
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neg. mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">anabhisa"nkharonta</span></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://abhisaṅkharoti">abhisaṅkharoti</a></p>

anabhisitta
