<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neuter</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">anaccekaciivara</span></p><p>what is not an <em>accekacīvara</em></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://acceka">acceka</a></p>

anacchariya
<p>[NCPED]</p><p></p><p>anacchariya<!-- raw HTML omitted -->1<!-- raw HTML omitted --></p><p>mfn. &amp; neuter not marvelous, not surprising; natural; not unusual, unexceptional; a natural thing or occurrence</p><p>anacchariya<!-- raw HTML omitted -->2<!-- raw HTML omitted --></p><p>mfn. spontaneous, original; not articulated (before).</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://acchariya">acchariya</a></p>

