anadhibhūta|anadhibhuuta|anadhibhuta
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neg. mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">anadhibhuuta</span></p><p>not overpowered</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://adhibhūta">adhibhūta</a></p>

anadhigama
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">masculine</i></p><p>lack of attainment</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://adhigama">adhigama</a></p>

