<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">part. pr. neg. mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">anadhivaasenta</span></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://adhivāsenta">adhivāsenta</a></p>

