<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">anajjhi.t.tha</span></p><p>adjective uncalled, unbidden, unasked Vin.i.113; Pv.i.12#3 (T. anabbhita, variant reading anijjhiṭṭha Ja.iii.165 has <em>anavhāta</em>; Thig.129 <em>ayācita</em>; Pv-a.64 explains by anavhāta).</p><p>an + ajjhiṭṭha</p>

