aneja
<p>[PTS]</p><p></p><p>adjective free from desires or lust DN.ii.157; Snp.920, Snp.1043, Snp.1101, Snp.1112; Iti.91 (opp. ejânuga Mnd.353 = Cnd.55; Dhp.414 (= taṇhāya abhāvena Dhp-a.iv.194), Dhp.422; Pv.iv.1#35 (nittaṇha Pv-a.230).</p><p>an + ejā</p>

anejakā|anejakaa|anejaka
