aneḷagaḷa|ane.laga.la|anelagala
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">ane.laga.la</span></p><p>(faultless (of speech, of voice)</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://aneḷagala">aneḷagala</a>, <a href="bword://anelagala">anelagala</a></p>

aneḷaka|ane.laka|anelaka
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">ane.laka</span></p><p>(of honey) pure</p><p>See also: anīlaka, <a href="bword://aniḷaka">aniḷaka</a>, <a href="bword://anelaka">anelaka</a></p>

aneḷaka|ane.laka|anelaka
