antaradhāyati|antaradhaayati|antaradhayati
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">antaradhaayati</span></p><p>to disappear Snp.449 (˚dhāyatha 3<!-- raw HTML omitted -->rd<!-- raw HTML omitted --> sg. med.); Vv.81#28 (id.); Ja.i.119 = Dhp-a.i.248; Dhp-a.iv.191 (ppr. ˚dhāyamāna &amp; aor. dhāyi) Pv-a.152, Pv-a.217, (˚dhāyi), Pv-a.245; Vv-a.48<br />ppr <em><a href="bword://antarahita">antarahita</a></em> (q.v.)<br />caus <em><a href="bword://antaradh%C4%81peti">antaradhāpeti</a></em> to cause to disappear, to destroy Ja.i.147; Ja.ii.415; Pv-a.123.</p><p>antara + dhāyati</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://antarahita">antarahita</a>, <a href="bword://antaradhāpeti">antaradhāpeti</a></p>

antaradhāyi|antaradhaayi|antaradhayi
