antaradhāyituṃ|antaradhaayitu.m|antaradhayitum
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">inf.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">antaradhaayitu.m</span></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://antaradhāyati">antaradhāyati</a></p>

antaradhāyiṃsu|antaradhaayi.msu|antaradhayimsu
