antaradhāytha|antaradhaaytha|antaradhaytha
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">aor. 3 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">antaradhaaytha</span></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://antaradhāyati">antaradhāyati</a></p>

antaragharaṃ|antaraghara.m|antaragharam
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">ind.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">antaraghara.m</span></p><p>between the houses, among the houses (i.e. in the village); within a house</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://antara">antara</a></p>

