anu FIXME double
<p>[NCPED]</p><p></p><p>anu-</p><p>ind.</p><ol><li><p>as prefix and preverb expresses: with, along; after, behind; subordinate to, inferior to; according to, in conformity with; severally one after the other; repeatedly</p></li><li><p>as separate preposition:</p><ol><li>with acc. and in prepositional compounds, expresses: according to, in conformity with; severally, each by each.</li><li>with loc. expresses: along, alongside</li></ol></li><li><p>as adverb.</p></li></ol>

