<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">anupa.t.thita</span></p><p>adjective setting out after, following, attacking Ja.v.452.</p><p>anu + pa + ṭhita</p>

anupekkhanatā|anupekkhanataa|anupekkhanata
