<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">part. pr. mfn.</i></p><p>Also written as: <a href="bword://anupekkhatt">anupekkhatt</a></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://anupekkhati">anupekkhati</a></p>

