<p>[PTS]</p><p></p><p>to go into DN.i.55 (+ anupagacchati) SN.iii.207; DN-a.i.165.</p><p>anu + pa + <em><a href="bword://i">i</a></em></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://i">i</a></p>

