anuposathikaṃ|anuposathika.m|anuposathikam
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">ind.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">anuposathika.m</span></p><p>every uposatha day.</p>

anuposathikaṃ|anuposathika.m|anuposathikam
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">anuposathika.m</span></p><p>see <em><a href="bword://anva%E1%B8%8D%E1%B8%8Dham%C4%81sa%E1%B9%83">anvaḍḍhamāsaṃ</a></em>.</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://anvaḍḍhamāsaṃ">anvaḍḍhamāsaṃ</a></p>

