anuḍahati|anu.dahati|anudahati
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">pr. 3 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">anu.dahati</span></p><p>burns; consumes</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://anudahati">anudahati</a></p>

anuḍahati|anu.dahati|anudahati
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">anu.dahati</span></p><p>to burn over again, burn thoroughly, fig. to destroy, consume Ja.ii.330; Ja.vi.423. Pass <em>-ḍayhati</em> Ja.v.426<br />■ Also spelt <em>-dahati</em>, e.g. at SN.iv.190 = SN.v.53; Thig.488.</p><p>anu + ḍahati</p>

anuḍasati|anu.dasati|anudasati
