anva-d-eva
<p>[NCPED]</p><p></p><p>anva-d-eva</p><p>ind. behind; afterwards.</p>

anvaddhamāsaṃ|anvaddhamaasa.m|anvaddhamasam
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">ind.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">anvaddhamaasa.m</span></p><p>every fortnight</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://anvaḍḍhamāsaṃ">anvaḍḍhamāsaṃ</a></p>

anvadeva
<p>[PTS]</p><p></p><p>adverb behind, after, later DN.i.172; MN.iii.172; SN.v.1 (spelt anudeva); AN.i.11; AN.v.214; Iti.34.</p><p>anva-d-eva with euphonic d.; like sammad-eva corresponding to Sk. anvag-eva</p>

anvagā|anvagaa|anvaga
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">anvagaa</span></p><p>3<!-- raw HTML omitted -->rd<!-- raw HTML omitted --> sg. aor. of anugacchati Mhvs.7, Mhvs.10. Also in assim. form <em>annagā</em> Ja.v.258.</p>

anvagū|anvaguu|anvagu
