<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">anaasaka</span></p><p>adjective fasting, not taking food SN.iv.118. f. <em>-ā</em> [cp. Sk. anāśaka nt.] fasting, abstaining from food Dhp.141 (= bhatta-paṭikkhepa Dhp-a.iii.77).</p><p>an + āsaka</p>

anāsakatta|anaasakatta|anasakatta
<p>[PTS]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neuter</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">anaasakatta</span></p><p>fasting Snp.249 (= abhojana Snp-a.292).</p><p>abstr. of anāsaka</p>

anāsakā|anaasakaa|anasaka
