anāsana|anaasana|anasana
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neuter</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">anaasana</span></p><p>an unsuitable seat, an unsuitable place for sitting</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://āsana">āsana</a></p>

