<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neg. mfn. &amp; neuter</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">anaasanna</span></p><p>not having approached; not near</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://āsanna">āsanna</a></p>

