asīti|asiiti|asiti
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">feminine</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">asiiti</span></p><p>num. eighty.</p>

asīti|asiiti|asiti
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">asiiti</span></p><p>number 80 (on symbolical meaning &amp; freq. application see; <em>aṭṭha<!-- raw HTML omitted -->1<!-- raw HTML omitted --></em> B 1 c, where also most of the ref’s In addition we mention the foll.:) Ja.i.233 (˚hattha 80 hands, i.e. 80 cubits deep); Ja.iii.174 (˚sahassa-vāraṇa-parivuta); Ja.vi.20 (vassasahassāni); Mil.23 (asītiyā bhikkhusahassehi saddhiṃ); Vism.46 (satakoṭiyo) Dhp-a.i.14, Dhp-a.i.19 (mahātherā); Dhp-a.ii.25 (˚koṭi-vibhava). Cp. ạ̄sītika.</p><p>Sk. aśīti</p>

asītika|asiitika|asitika
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">asiitika</span></p><p>of eighty years; eighty years old.</p>

asūra|asuura|asura
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">asuura</span></p><p>adjective</p><ol><li><p>not brave, not valiant, cowardly Snp.439.</p></li><li><p>uncouth, stupid Ja.vi.292 (cp. Kern</p><blockquote><p>Toevoegselen</p></blockquote><p>p. 48).</p></li></ol><p>a + sura<!-- raw HTML omitted -->1<!-- raw HTML omitted --></p>

asūyaka|asuuyaka|asuyaka
