atīradassin|atiiradassin|atiradassin
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">atiiradassin</span></p><p>adjective noun not seeing the shore Ja.i.46; Ja.vi.440; also as <em>atīradassanī</em> (f.) Ja.v.75 <em>(nāvā)</em>. Cp. DN.i.222.</p><p>a + tīra + dassin</p>

atīraka|atiiraka|atiraka
