atītasmim|atiitasmim|atitasmim
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">adv.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">atiitasmim</span></p><p>in the past</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://atīta">atīta</a></p>

atītayobbana|atiitayobbana|atitayobbana
