ayokaṭāha|ayoka.taaha|ayokataha
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">masculine</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">ayoka.taaha</span></p><p>an iron pot or pan</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://ayas">ayas</a>, ayakaṭaha</p>

