aññātāvindriya|a~n~naataavindriya|annatavindriya
<p>[Nyana]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">a~n~naataavindriya</span></p><p><strong>Aññātāvindriya:</strong> T he ability of one who knows; see: <em>indriya</em> 22.</p>

aññāvada|a~n~naavada|annavada
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">masculine a</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">a~n~naavada</span></p><p>statement of what is known (?).</p>

aññāya|a~n~naaya|annaya
