<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">masculine a</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">a.msabaddha</span></p><p>shoulder strap.</p>

aṃsabandhaka|a.msabandhaka|amsabandhaka
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">masculine a</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">a.msabandhaka</span></p><p>shoulder strap.</p>

