aṃsi|a.msi|amsi
<p>[PTS]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">feminine a</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">a.msi</span></p><p>corner, edge (= <em>aṃsa<!-- raw HTML omitted -->2<!-- raw HTML omitted --></em> Vv.78#2 (= <em>aṃsa-bhāga</em> Vv-a.303).</p><p>cp. Vedic aśri, aśra, aśani; Gr. α ̓́κρος pointed, α ̓́κρις, also ὀςύς sharp: Lat. ācer sharp. Further connections in Walde Lat. Wtb. under ācer</p>

aṃsu|a.msu|amsu
