<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">a.t.thapadakataa</span></p><p>arranged in an <em>aṭṭhapada</em>, plaited eightfold</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://aṭṭhapada">aṭṭhapada</a></p>

