aṭṭharasa|a.t.tharasa|attharasa
<p>[NCPED]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">a.t.tharasa</span></p><p>num. &amp; mfn. 18</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://aṭṭha">aṭṭha</a></p>

