aṭṭhilla|a.t.thilla|atthilla
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">a.t.thilla</span></p><p>at Vin.ii.266 is expl<!-- raw HTML omitted -->d.<!-- raw HTML omitted --> by Bdhgh on p. 327 by gojanghaṭṭika, perhaps more likely = Sk. aṣṭhīlā a round pebble or stone.</p>

