aṭṭhita|a.t.thita|atthita
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">a.t.thita</span></p><p>Aṭṭhita<!-- raw HTML omitted -->1<!-- raw HTML omitted --></p><p>see <em><a href="bword://%E1%B9%ADhita">ṭhita</a></em>.</p><p>Aṭṭhita<!-- raw HTML omitted -->2<!-- raw HTML omitted --></p><p>undertaken, arrived at, looked after, considered Ja.ii.247 (= adhiṭṭhita C.).</p><p>ā + ṭhita</p><p>Aṭṭhita<!-- raw HTML omitted -->3<!-- raw HTML omitted --></p><p>see <em><a href="bword://atthika">atthika</a></em>.</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://ṭhita">ṭhita</a>, <a href="bword://atthika">atthika</a></p>

