<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">masculine &amp; neuter a</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">cammakha.n.da</span></p><p>piece of leather used for sitting upon.</p>

cammakāra|cammakaara|cammakara
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">masculine a</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">cammakaara</span></p><p>leather worker; a shoe maker.</p>

cammapaṭṭa|cammapa.t.ta|cammapatta
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">masculine a</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">cammapa.t.ta</span></p><p>flat leather thong?</p>

