cetāpana|cetaapana|cetapana
<p>[PTS]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neuter</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">cetaapana</span></p><p>barter Vin.iii.216, see also <em>Vin. Texts</em> i.22 &amp; Kacc. 322.</p><p>see <em><a href="bword://cet%C4%81peti">cetāpeti</a></em>; cp. BSk. cetanika</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://cetāpeti">cetāpeti</a></p>

