cetāpeti|cetaapeti|cetapeti
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">pr. 3 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">cetaapeti</span></p><p>(of a <em>bhikkhu</em> or bhikkhunl) has someone give or exchange or buy; (of a layman) exchanges; buys.</p>

cetāpeti|cetaapeti|cetapeti
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">cetaapeti</span></p><p>to get in exchange, to barter, buy Vin.iii.216 (explained by parivatteti), Vin.iii.237; Vin.iv.250.</p><p>Caus. of *cetati to <em><a href="bword://ci">ci</a></em>, collect; see also Kern,</p><blockquote><p>Toevoegselen</p></blockquote><p>s. v.</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://ci">ci</a></p>

