chaḍḍayitvāna|cha.d.dayitvaana|chaddayitvana
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">absol.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">cha.d.dayitvaana</span></p><p>of chaḍḍeti</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://chaḍḍeti">chaḍḍeti</a></p>

