chedāpayat|chedaapayat|chedapayat
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">part. pr. mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">chedaapayat</span></p><p>Also written as: <a href="bword://chedāpayat">chedāpayat</a></p><p>of chedāpeti</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://chedāpeti">chedāpeti</a></p>

