chādana|chaadana|chadana
<p>[PTS]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neuter</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">chaadana</span></p><p>covering. clothing, often combined with <em>ghāsa˚</em>; food &amp; clothing (q.v.) Ja.ii.79 (vattha˚) Pv.i.10#7 (bhojana˚); Pv.ii.1#7 (vattha˚); Pv-a.50 (= vattha) Dhp-a.iv.7<br />■ As adj. Ja.vi.354 (of the thatch of a house).</p><p>to chādeti</p>

chādanā|chaadanaa|chadana
<p>[PTS]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">feminine</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">chaadanaa</span></p><p>covering, concealment Pp.19, Pp.23. Cp. pari˚.</p><p>fr. chādeti</p>

