chārattaparamaṃ|chaarattaparama.m|charattaparamam
<p>[NCPED]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">chaarattaparama.m</span></p><p>indeclinable for six nights at the most.</p>

chārattaṃ|chaaratta.m|charattam
