citi
<p>[PTS]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">feminine a</i></p><p>heap, made of bricks Ja.vi.204 (city-avayata-piṭṭhikā). See also cetiya.</p><p>From <em><a href="bword://ci">ci</a></em>, cināti, to heap up</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://ci">ci</a></p>

citra
