<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">mfn.</i></p><p>adorned; painted.</p>

cittakathika
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">mfn.</i></p><p>one who speaks brilliantly; whose talk is varied.</p>

