<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">masculine a</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">cittakaaraka</span></p><p>painter.</p>

cittalatā|cittalataa|cittalata
<p>[Dhammika]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">cittalataa</span></p><p><em>Marsdenia tenacissima</em>, Hindi <em>chiti</em> Ja.vi.278, a stout climber with velvety ovate leaves and green flowers. Fiber from this plant is very strong and is used to make bow strings and fishing lines.</p>

cittamiga
