<p>[DPPN]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">cittapaa.tali</span></p><p>A tree in the Asurabhavana SN.v.238 which lives for a whole aeon.</p>

cittapāṭalī|cittapaa.talii|cittapatali
