<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">1 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">dakkhisa.m</span></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://dakkhissaṃ">dakkhissaṃ</a></p>

dakkhissaṃ|dakkhissa.m|dakkhissam
