<p>[PTS]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">a</i></p><p>pin of tooth or ivory; <em>makara˚</em>; the tooth of a sword-fish Vin.ii.113, Vin.ii.117; Vin.iv.47. See details under makara.</p>

