devakāya|devakaaya|devakaya
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">masculine a</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">devakaaya</span></p><p>deva world or sphere; a collective body of devas.</p>

devaloka
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">masculine</i></p><p>the world of the gods; a sphere of the gods.</p>

devalokagamanīya|devalokagamaniiya|devalokagamaniya
