devasabha
<p>[DPPN]</p><p></p><p>A monk whose Theragāthā verse speaks of how one with right effort will overcome defilements. Thag.100</p>

devasadda
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">masculine</i></p><p>shout of the devas; sound of the devas; thunder.</p>

devasika
