devatta
<p>[PTS]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neuter</i></p><p>the state of being a deva, divinity Thag-a.70; Pv-a.110 (˚bhāva as Yakkha, opp. petatta bhāva; so read for devatā-bhāva).</p><p>deva + tta</p>

devattana
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neuter abstr.</i></p><p>the state of being a deva.</p>

