dhakkhiṇena|dhakkhi.nena|dhakkhinena
<p>[NCPED]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">dhakkhi.nena</span></p><p>adverb on the south or right side; to the south.</p>

dhakkhiṇā|dhakkhi.naa|dhakkhina
