<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">di.t.thaka</span></p><p>adjective seen, visible, apparent Dhp-a.ii.53, Dhp-a.ii.90.</p><p>= diṭṭha<!-- raw HTML omitted -->1<!-- raw HTML omitted --></p>

