dussaka
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">mfn.</i></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://dūsaka">dūsaka</a></p>

dussaka
<p>[PTS]</p><p></p><p>= dūsaka (q.v.).</p>

dussamuṭṭhāpaya|dussamu.t.thaapaya|dussamutthapaya
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">dussamu.t.thaapaya</span></p><p>hard to raise.</p>

dussamādaha|dussamaadaha|dussamadaha
