dussapaṭṭa|dussapa.t.ta|dussapatta
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">masculine a</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">dussapa.t.ta</span></p><p>strip of cloth.</p>

dussassa
