duttitikkha
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">mfn.</i></p><p>hard to endure</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://titikkhā">titikkhā</a></p>

dutīya|dutiiya|dutiya
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">dutiiya</span></p><p>, m.f.</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://dutiya">dutiya</a></p>

