<p>[NCPED]</p><p></p><p>adverb in two ways; as of two kinds; in a twofold way.</p>

duvijātā|duvijaataa|duvijata
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">(m)f(n). a</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">duvijaataa</span></p><p>woman who has given birth twice.</p>

