<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">mfn. &amp; neuter</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">dvaadasanahuta</span></p><p>(numbering) 120, 000</p>

dvādasaporisa|dvaadasaporisa|dvadasaporisa
