dālayati|daalayati|dalayati
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">caus. pr. 3 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">daalayati</span></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://dāleti">dāleti</a></p>

dālayitvā|daalayitvaa|dalayitva
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">absol.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">daalayitvaa</span></p><p>of dāleti</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://dāleti">dāleti</a></p>

