dāruka|daaruka|daruka
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">daaruka</span></p><p>(cp. dāru) a log SN.i.202 = Thag.62 = Dhp-a.iii.460; adj. made of wood Thig.390 (˚cillaka, a wooden post see Thag-a.257).</p>

dārukapillaka|daarukapillaka|darukapillaka
