ekadvīhikā|ekadviihikaa|ekadvihika
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">feminine</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">ekadviihikaa</span></p><p>one day; two days etc.; after one or two days</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://eka">eka</a></p>

ekadā|ekadaa|ekada
