ekadā|ekadaa|ekada
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">ekadaa</span></p><p>adverb once, at the same time, at one time, once upon a time SN.i.162; Snp.198; Dhp-a.ii.41; Mil.213.</p><p>fr. eka</p>

