<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">ekajjha.m</span></p><p>adverb in the same place, in conjunction together Mil.144 (karoti), Kp-a.167; Snp-a.38.</p><p>fr. eka, cp. literary Sk. aikadhyaṃ, but BSk. ekadhyaṃ Mvu.i.304</p>

