<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">feminine</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">ghaa.nadhatu</span></p><p>the constituent element that is the nose (as sense organ)</p>

ghāṇaviññeyya|ghaa.navi~n~neyya|ghanavinneyya
