gonaddha
<p>[DPPN]</p><p></p><p>One of the places passed by Bāvarī’s disciples on their way from Bāvarī’s hermitage to see the Buddha at Rājagaha.</p><p>Between Gonaddha and their starting place lay Patitthāna, Māhissati and Ujjeni, and the next stopping place after Gonaddha was Vedisā. Sn.vs.1011.</p><p>23.415453,77.072485town</p>

