impersonality
<p>[Nyana]</p><p></p><p><strong>Impersonality:</strong> see: <em>anattā</em> - Contemplation of: see: <em>vipassanā</em> 3.</p>

imperturbable karma-formations
<p>[Nyana]</p><p></p><p><strong>[[imperturbable karma-formations]]Imperturbable kammic-constructions:</strong> <em>āneñjābhisankhāra</em> see: <em>sankhāra</em></p>

