kassaṃ|kassa.m|kassam
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">1 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">kassa.m</span></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://karoti">karoti</a></p>

kassāma|kassaama|kassama
<p>[PTS]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">fut.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">kassaama</span></p><p>of karoti.</p>

