<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">kattukaama</span></p><p>wishing to do or make; intending to do or carry out</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://kattuṃ">kattuṃ</a></p>

kattuṃ|kattu.m|kattum
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">part. pr. mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">kattu.m</span></p><p>doing, acting.</p>

kattā|kattaa|katta
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">absol.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">kattaa</span></p><p>having done or made.</p>

