<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">1 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">kayiraa</span></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://karoti">karoti</a></p>

kayirātha|kayiraatha|kayiratha
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">1 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">kayiraatha</span></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://karoti">karoti</a></p>

