kiṅkiṇika|ki"nki.nika|kinkinika
<p>[PTS]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">masculine neuter a</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">ki"nki.nika</span></p><p>small bell Ja.iv.259, Ja.iv.413; (suvaṇṇa˚); Vv.78#1 (= kinkiṇi Vv-a.303); Vin.iii.42 (kinkiṇikā saddo).</p><ul><li><em>-<a href="bword://j%C4%81la">jāla</a></em> a net or fringe of tinkling bells DN.ii.183; Ja.i.32; Dhp-a.i.274.</li></ul><p>onomat. formation fr. sound part. kiṇi, see note on gala</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://jāla">jāla</a></p>

