kiṇakiṇāyati|ki.naki.naayati|kinakinayati
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">ki.naki.naayati</span></p><p>to tinkle; also spelt kiṇikiṇāyati Ja.iii.315. See also kilikilāyati and cp. Sk. kiṭikiṭāyati to grind (one’s teeth) &amp; Prk. kiḍikiḍiya (chattering) Weber, <em>Bhagavatī</em> p. 289; also BSk. kaṭakaṭāyati Lal.251. See taṭataṭayati &amp; note on gala.</p><p>= kinkiṇāyati, denom. fr. kinkiṇi, small bell</p>

