kākātidāyi|kaakaatidaayi|kakatidayi
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">kaakaatidaayi</span></p><p>Also written as: <a href="bword://kākātidāyin">kākātidāyin</a></p><p>flown through by crows, open to the crows</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://kāka">kāka</a></p>

kākātidāyin|kaakaatidaayin|kakatidayin
