<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">kaarikaa</span></p><p>see <em><a href="bword://k%C4%81raka">kāraka</a></em></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://kāraka">kāraka</a></p>

kārin|kaarin|karin
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">kaarin</span></p><p>(-˚) adjective doing: yathāvādī tathākārī “as he says so he does” DN.iii.135, Snp.357; see for examples the various compounds as kamma˚, kibbisa˚, khaṇḍa˚, chidda˚ dukkaṭa˚, dvaya˚, paccakkha˚, pubba˚, sakkacca˚ sampajāna˚, etc.</p>

kārita|kaarita|karita
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">pp mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">kaarita</span></p><p>caused to be made</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://kāreti">kāreti</a></p>

kāritā|kaaritaa|karita
