kāriyamāna|kaariyamaana|kariyamana
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">pass. part. pr. mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">kaariyamaana</span></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://kāreti">kāreti</a></p>

kāruka|kaaruka|karuka
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">masculine a</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">kaaruka</span></p><p>maker; an artisan.</p>

kāruñña|kaaru~n~na|karunna
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neuter &amp; mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">kaaru~n~na</span></p><p>compassion.</p>

