kārā|kaaraa|kara
<p>[PTS]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">feminine</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">kaaraa</span></p><p>confinement, captivity, jail, in <em>-bhedaka</em> cora a thief who has broken out of jail Vin.i.75.</p><p>cp. Sk. kārā</p>

