kārāpeti|kaaraapeti|karapeti
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">caus. pr. 3 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">kaaraapeti</span></p><p>cause to make or do; has (something) made or done</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://kārāpayati">kārāpayati</a>, <a href="bword://karoti">karoti</a></p>

