kāyānupassin|kaayaanupassin|kayanupassin
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">kaayaanupassin</span></p><p>Also written as: <a href="bword://kāyānupassin">kāyānupassin</a></p><p>considering contemplation of the body</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://kāya">kāya</a></p>

kāyāyatana|kaayaayatana|kayayatana
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neuter</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">kaayaayatana</span></p><p>the sense organ that is the body</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://kāya">kāya</a></p>

