<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neuter a</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">kaayuura</span></p><p>bracelet (worn on the upper arm); an arm-guard; (according to commentaries) a neck-ornament, a necklace</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://kāyura">kāyura</a></p>

kāyūra|kaayuura|kayura
