namassamāna|namassamaana|namassamana
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">part. pr. mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">namassamaana</span></p><p>of namassati</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://namassati">namassati</a></p>

namassana
