nibbiṭṭha|nibbi.t.tha|nibbittha
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">nibbi.t.tha</span></p><p>past participle gained, earned Vin.iv.265; Snp.25; Snp-a.38.</p><p>nis + viṭṭha, of nibbisati</p>

nibbiṭṭharājabhaṭa|nibbi.t.tharaajabha.ta|nibbittharajabhata
