<p>[PTS]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neuter</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">nibbaapana</span></p><p>means of extinguishing, extinction, quenching SN.i.188 (cittaṃ pariḍayhati: nibbāpanaṃ brūhi = allayment of the glow); AN.iv.320 (celassa n˚āya chandaṃ karoti: try to put out the burning cloth); Mil.302 (jhāyamāno n˚ṃ alabhamāno), Mil.318 (pariḷāha˚).</p><p>abstr. fr. nibbāpeti</p>

