nihantvā|nihantvaa|nihantva
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">pr. 3 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">nihantvaa</span></p><p>of nihanati</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://nihanati">nihanati</a></p>

niharati
