nijjaṭa|nijja.ta|nijjata
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">nijja.ta</span></p><p>adjective disentangled Ja.i.187; Mil.3.</p><p>Sk. *nirjaṭa, nis + jaṭa, adj. to jaṭā</p>

nijjhapana
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neuter</i></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://nijjhāpana">nijjhāpana</a></p>

