<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">pr. 3 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">nijjhaayati</span></p><p>looks at, observes carefully; scrutinizes; reflects on; meditates (on)</p>

nijjhāyati|nijjhaayati|nijjhayati
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">nijjhaayati</span></p><p>Nijjhāyati<!-- raw HTML omitted -->1<!-- raw HTML omitted --></p><p>to meditate, reflect, think SN.iii.140 sq. (+ passati, cp. jānāti), SN.iii.157; MN.i.334 (jhāyati n. apajjhāyati); MN.iii.14 (id.). Cp. upa˚.</p><p>Sk. nidhyāyati, ni + jhāyati<!-- raw HTML omitted -->1<!-- raw HTML omitted --></p><p>Nijjhāyati<!-- raw HTML omitted -->2<!-- raw HTML omitted --></p><p>to be consumed (by sorrow), to fret Mnd.433.</p><p>ni + jhāyati<!-- raw HTML omitted -->2<!-- raw HTML omitted --></p>

nijjhāyi|nijjhaayi|nijjhayi
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">aor. 3 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">nijjhaayi</span></p><p>of nijjhāyati</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://nijjhāyati">nijjhāyati</a></p>

