nāmaṃ gaṇhāti|naama.m ga.nhaati|namam ganhati
<p>[NCPED]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">naama.m ga.nhaati</span></p><p>of nama names, mentions or addresses by name</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://nāma">nāma</a></p>

nāmetabba|naametabba|nametabba
