ohāreti|ohaareti|ohareti
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">ohaareti</span></p><ol><li>to give up, leave behind, renounce (cp. ojahāti) Snp.64 (= oropeti Cnd.183).</li><li>to take down (see <em><a href="bword://oharati">oharati</a></em> 1) Vin.i.48; Pv-a.95.</li><li>to cut down, shave off (hair; see oharāpeti under oharati) Iti.75 (kesamassuṃ hair &amp; beard, variant reading ohāyāpetvā); Pp.56 (id.).</li></ol><p>Caus. of oharati</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://oharati">oharati</a></p>

ohāri|ohaari|ohari
