oḍḍita|o.d.dita|oddita
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">o.d.dita</span></p><p>thrown out, laid (of a snare) Ja.i.183; Ja.ii.443; Ja.v.341; Thag-a.243.</p><p>pp. of oḍḍeti</p>

