sapattī|sapattii|sapatti
<p>[PTS]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">feminine a</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">sapattii</span></p><p>co-wife DN.ii.330; Ja.i.398; Ja.iv.316, Ja.iv.491; Thig.224; Dhp-a.i.47. <em><a href="bword://asapatt%C4%AB">asapattī</a></em> without any co-wife SN.iv.249.</p><p>Sk. sapatnī</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://asapattī">asapattī</a></p>

