sattu
<p>[PTS]</p><p></p><p>Sattu<!-- raw HTML omitted -->1<!-- raw HTML omitted --></p><p>an enemy Ja.v.94 (acc. pl. sattavo); Vism.234 (˚nimmathana).</p><p>Vedic śatru</p><p>Sattu<!-- raw HTML omitted -->2<!-- raw HTML omitted --></p><p>barley-meal, flour Vin.ii.116 (satthu); Mnd.372; Ja.iii.343 sq.; Pv.iii.1#3; Dhs.646.</p><ul><li><em>-<a href="bword://%C4%81pa%E1%B9%87a">āpaṇa</a></em> baker’s shop Ja.vi.365.</li><li><em>-<a href="bword://pasibbaka">pasibbaka</a></em> flour sack</li><li><em>-bhasta</em> id. Ja.iii.346.</li></ul><p>cp. Sk. śaktu</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://āpaṇa">āpaṇa</a>, <a href="bword://pasibbaka">pasibbaka</a></p>

