sayana
<p>[PTS]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">neuter</i></p><ol><li>lying down, sleeping Vism.26; Pv-a.80 (mañca˚).</li><li>bed, couch Vin.i.57, Vin.i.72; Vin.ii.123; DN.i.5, DN.i.7; AN.i.132; Ja.ii.88; Ja.v.110 (˚ṃ attharāpeti to spread out a bed); Mil.243, Mil.348; Mnd.372 (˚sannidhi); Pv.i.11#7 (kis˚ = kiṃ˚); Pv-a.78<br />■ sayanakalaha a quarrel in the bedroom, a curtain-lecture Ja.iii.20; sayanāsana bed seat Iti.112; Dhp.185, etc.: see <em><a href="bword://sen%C4%81sana">senāsana</a></em>.</li></ol><p>fr. <em>śī</em></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://senāsana">senāsana</a></p>

sayanighara
