sukathā|sukathaa|sukatha
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">feminine a</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">sukathaa</span></p><p>good discourse, well directed talk</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://kathā">kathā</a></p>

sukaṭadukkaṭa|suka.tadukka.ta|sukatadukkata
