sukheti
<p>[PTS]</p><p></p><p>to make happy DN.i.51; SN.iv.331; DN-a.i.157; also <em>sukhayati</em> Dhs-a.117; Caus. ii. <em>sukhāpeti</em> DN.ii.202; Mil.79<br />pp <em><a href="bword://sukhita">sukhita</a></em>.</p><p>Caus. fr. sukha</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://sukhita">sukhita</a></p>

