tiṇahaṃsa|ti.naha.msa|tinahamsa
<p>[Dhammika]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">ti.naha.msa</span></p><p>A type of water bird Ja.v.356. The name means “grass goose” or “grass duck”.</p>

