<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">ti.nha</span></p><p>sharp (of swords, axes, knives, etc.) DN.i.56 (sattha); SN.iv.160, SN.iv.167 (kuṭhārī); AN.iv.171; Snp.667 (˚dhāra), Snp.673 (asipattavana); Ja.i.253; Sdhp.381.</p><p>see <em><a href="bword://tikhi%E1%B9%87a">tikhiṇa</a></em></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://tikhiṇa">tikhiṇa</a></p>

