<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">ti.t.tha</span></p><p>adjective dry, hard, rough Ja.vi.212 (˚sela hard rock).</p><p>pp. of tasati<!-- raw HTML omitted -->1<!-- raw HTML omitted --></p>

tiṭṭhabhadantika|ti.t.thabhadantika|titthabhadantika
