upanidhā|upanidhaa|upanidha
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">feminine</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">upanidhaa</span></p><p>setting beside; comparison; similarity.</p>

upanidhā|upanidhaa|upanidha
<p>[PTS]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">feminine</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">upanidhaa</span></p><p>comparison Cnd.158 (= upamā; should we read upanidhāya?).</p><p>abstracted from upanidhāya or direct formation fr. upa + ni + <em>dhā</em>?</p>

