<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">ind.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">upanidhaaya</span></p><p>placing near to, setting beside (for comparison); in comparison with (acc. or dat./gen.); in reference to.</p>

upanidhāya|upanidhaaya|upanidhaya
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">upanidhaaya</span></p><p>indeclinable comparing in comparison, as prep. w. acc. “compared with” MN.i.374; MN.iii.177 (Himavantaṃ pabbatarājānaṃ); SN.ii.133 (mahāpaṭhaviṃ), SN.ii.262; SN.v.457 (Sineru-pabbata-rājānaṃ) AN.iii.181 sq.; AN.iv.253 sq. (dibbasukhaṃ); Thag.496 (kammaṃ); Ja.ii.93; DN-a.i.29, DN-a.i.59, DN-a.i.283.</p><p>ger. of upa + nidahati of <em>dhā</em></p>

