L omitted --> form of uttara, cp. angi-bhūta uttāni-karoti etc.</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://uttariṃ">uttariṃ</a>, <a href="bword://vuttari">vuttari</a>, <a href="bword://karaṇīya">karaṇīya</a>, <a href="bword://bhaṅga">bhaṅga</a>, <a href="bword://manussa">manussa</a>, <a href="bword://sāṭaka">sāṭaka</a></p>

