<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">part. pr. mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aagamayamaana</span></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://āgamayati">āgamayati</a></p>

āgamayati|aagamayati|agamayati
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">pr. 3 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aagamayati</span></p><p>waits, waits for; expects</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://āgameti">āgameti</a>, <a href="bword://āgacchati">āgacchati</a></p>

āgamaṃ|aagama.m|agamam
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">1 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aagama.m</span></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://āgacchati">āgacchati</a></p>

āgamaṃsu|aagama.msu|agamamsu
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">3 plural</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aagama.msu</span></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://āgacchati">āgacchati</a></p>

