āgametabba|aagametabba|agametabba
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">fpp mfn. &amp; n. impers.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aagametabba</span></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://āgameti">āgameti</a></p>

āgameti|aagameti|agameti
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">pr. 3 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aagameti</span></p><p>waits, waits for; expects</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://āgamayati">āgamayati</a>, <a href="bword://āgacchati">āgacchati</a></p>

āgameti|aagameti|agameti
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aagameti</span></p><p>to cause somebody or something to come to one, i.e.</p><ol><li>to wait, to stay Vin.ii.166, Vin.ii.182, Vin.ii.212; DN.i.112, DN.i.113; SN.iv.291; Pv-a.4, Pv-a.55.</li><li>to wait for, to welcome Vin.ii.128 (ppr. āgamayamāna); MN.i.161 (id.) Ja.i.69 (id. + kālaṃ).</li></ol><p>caus of agacchati</p>

