āhārayat|aahaarayat|aharayat
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">part. pr. mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aahaarayat</span></p><p>Also written as: <a href="bword://āhārayat">āhārayat</a></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://āhārayati">āhārayati</a></p>

