<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">caus. pr. 3 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aahaareti</span></p><p>eats</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://āhārayati">āhārayati</a>, <a href="bword://āharati">āharati</a></p>

āhāreti|aahaareti|ahareti
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aahaareti</span></p><p>to take food, eat, feed on SN.ii.13; SN.iii.240; SN.iv.104; AN.i.114, AN.i.295; AN.ii.40, AN.ii.145, AN.ii.206; AN.iv.167; Cnd.540#c (āhāraṃ &amp; puttamaṃsaṃ cp. SN.ii.98).</p><p>Denom. fr. āhāra</p>

