<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">masculine</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aahaarupaccheda</span></p><p>cutting off food; abstinence from food</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://āhāra">āhāra</a></p>

