āhāsi|aahaasi|ahasi
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">aor. 3 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aahaasi</span></p><p>spoken; declared, related; quoted</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://āharati">āharati</a></p>

