ālayesin|aalayesin|alayesin
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aalayesin</span></p><p>Also written as: <a href="bword://ālayesin">ālayesin</a></p><p>seeking shelter; seeing the nest</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://ālaya">ālaya</a></p>

