āsiñcitvā|aasi~ncitvaa|asincitva
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">absol.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aasi~ncitvaa</span></p><p>having poured on or into; dripped</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://āsiñcati">āsiñcati</a></p>

