āsiṃ|aasi.m|asim
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aasi.m</span></p><p>Āsi &amp; Āsiṃ</p><p>3<!-- raw HTML omitted -->rd<!-- raw HTML omitted --> &amp; 1<!-- raw HTML omitted -->st<!-- raw HTML omitted --> sg. aor. of <em><a href="bword://atthi">atthi</a></em> (q.v.).</p><p>See also: <a href="bword://atthi">atthi</a></p>

