<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aasi.msanaka</span></p><p>adjective hoping for something, lit. praising somebody for the sake of gain, cadging Thag-a.217 (for āsaṃsuka Thig.273).</p><p>fr. āsiṃsanā</p>

āsiṃsaniya|aasi.msaniya|asimsaniya
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aasi.msaniya</span></p><p>adjective to be wished for, desirable Mil.2 (˚ratana).</p><p>grd. of āsiṃsati</p>

āsiṃsanā|aasi.msanaa|asimsana
<p>[PTS]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">feminine</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aasi.msanaa</span></p><p>desire, wish, craving Ja.v.28; Dhs.1059, Dhs.1136 (+ āsiṃsitatta). As <em>āsīsanā</em> at Ne.53.</p><p>abstr. fr. ā + <em>śaṃs</em>, cp. āsiṃsati</p>

āsiṃsat|aasi.msat|asimsat
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">part. pr. mfn.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aasi.msat</span></p><p>Also written as: <a href="bword://āsiṃsat">āsiṃsat</a></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://āsiṃsati">āsiṃsati</a></p>

