<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">pr. 3 sg.</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aasi.msati</span></p><p>hopes for; desires.</p>

āsiṃsati|aasi.msati|asimsati
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aasi.msati</span></p><p>to hope for wish, pray for (lit. praise for the sake of gain), desire (w. acc.) SN.i.34, SN.i.62; Snp.779, Snp.1044, Snp.1046 (see Cnd.135) Ja.i.267; Ja.iii.251; Ja.iv.18; Ja.v.435; Ja.vi.43; Mnd.60; Mhvs.30, Mhvs.100; Vv-a.337; Pv-a.226 (ppr. āsiṃsamāna for āsamāna, q.v.).</p><p>Sk. āśaṃsati, ā + <em>śaṃs</em>, cp. also <em>śās</em> &amp; āsāsati, further abhisaṃsati, abhisiṃsati &amp; āsaṃsati</p>

