āsumhati|aasumhati|asumhati
<p>[PTS]</p><p> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aasumhati</span></p><p>Āsumbhati &amp; Āsumhati</p><p>to bring to fall, throw down or round, sling round Vin.iv.263 Vin.iv.265; Vv.50#11 (˚itvāna); Ja.iii.435 (aor. āsumhi, gloss khipi).</p><p>ā + <em>śumbh</em> to glide</p>

āsuṃ|aasu.m|asum
<p>[NCPED]</p><p><i style="color: #448C19;">3 plural</i> | <span style="color: #0B4A72;">aasu.m</span></p><p>See also: <a href="bword://atthi">atthi</a></p>

